        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GVCGVCCOM, Grande Victorian Single Cylinder Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe design of Grandeur's Grande Victorian Single Cylinder Combo is very intricate, every inch of it covered in the ornate stylings of the old world. The Grande Victorian Entryset is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The ornate egg shaped Grande Victorian Knob paired with the matching deadbolt will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. This romantically designed entry set is made of solid brass. A single cylinder entryset, it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Grande Victorian Combo fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-grande-victorian-series\"><b>Grande Victorian Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GVCGVCCOM Grande Victorian Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grande Victorian Single Cylinder Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Height: 8.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Plate Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Width: 1.64\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.42\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.76\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-knob.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GVC-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Grande Victorian Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
